    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule in the provided evidence.",
    "Some evidence cards are not structurally matched to their listed SMILES, adding uncertainty to record-level transfer."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

